  <section class="revenue-followup-section" id="sales-follow-up-process">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-label">Follow-up and ownership</div>
      <h2>Every real opportunity needs a next step and an owner.</h2>
      <p>Follow-up problems rarely come from a total absence of effort. They come from loose rules. Nobody knows how quickly to act, which channel to use, when to escalate, how many attempts make sense, what must be recorded or when a stalled opportunity should leave the active pipeline.</p>
      <p>The Revenue Engine can define response windows, contact standards, next-step requirements, ownership changes, handoff notes, reactivation rules and clean close reasons. The goal is not more tasks. The goal is fewer valuable opportunities dying between people and systems.</p>
    </div>
